  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Val-d'Or, Canada, Artemya Tattoo is a haven where art blooms on skin. Specializing in delicate floral, sophisticated black & gray, and precise fineline tattoos, this appointment-only studio offers both custom designs and flash tattoos in an atmosphere that's as welcoming as it is creative. Let the masterful artists @geme_tattoo and @megart.tattoo in Artemya Tattoo transform your ideas into inked masterpieces.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Val-d'or, Quebec, Canada"
